Subject: [PATCH 38/48] Era: the player side deals and heals less in old
 content (0.75 vanilla, 0.85 TBC: players, pets, NPCBots; Northrend as built);
 mounts take 3 s to summon again (as before 3.2)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JU37XfnHTvru3VVz2sNN7z
